# Docker build context is the REPO ROOT (see platform/Dockerfile), so the
# ignore rules must live here — platform/.dockerignore no longer applies.
# NOTE: corpus/ is deliberately NOT ignored; @platform/corpus static-imports it.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
platform/data
platform/reports
**/qa-report
**/ux-report
Baseball.worktrees
